<title>AUSTRALIA: Australia April-June rainfall looks normal-Bureau.</title>
<headline>Australia April-June rainfall looks normal-Bureau.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Australian Bureau of Meteorology said on Friday that its outlook for total rainfall across Australia between April and June indicated no significant bias toward either wetter or drier than normal conditions.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
